and testing your aim and reflexes in electrifying combat! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332120/extras/f6cba99e9381ca5e441573afabe3d9f5.poster.avif?t=1749235531\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332120/extras/f6cba99e9381ca5e441573afabe3d9f5.webm?t=1749235531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR HUNTING DECK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each mission, carefully select cards for your hunting deck, each with unique effects. Build the perfect strategy for each job by combining skills to maximize your chances of success! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332120/extras/eceeb6da0f10d0f26f846c532fba7b85.poster.avif?t=1749235531\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332120/extras/eceeb6da0f10d0f26f846c532fba7b85.webm?t=1749235531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MORE FEATURES:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re developing exciting new features for this game! Here\u2019s what you can expect: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guaranteed variety! Face different targets in every game, with thousands of possible combinations. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deck full of cards for you to create innovative strategies and have fun every time! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a new world and unique challenges with every mafia boss, leading up to the dreaded Big Boss. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay sharp: the characters in the cards will try to escape and interact with the environment. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be quick and observant: your targets can use special cards to counterattack or flee. Your reaction must be immediate! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost your notoriety: earn rewards, acquire new cards, climb the Most Wanted rankings, and become a legend! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332120/extras/0922b0c40d05a544fed1effe1fee8f9e.poster.avif?t=1749235531\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332120/extras/0922b0c40d05a544fed1effe1fee8f9e.webm?t=1749235531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COMMUNITY:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to help develop the game and join exclusive promotions and closed beta tests? Join us on Discord and become part of our community! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332120/extras/2f765ede52c4155eb661776e476459da.webp?t=1749235531\" /></span></p>",
